        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1701043061/performances/OC11IS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Le collectif techno OCTOV : Dopamyne + H1bou + Ponsif"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>On September 11, Espace St-Denis, OCTOV and the Quartier Latin join forces as part of the belle grosse rentrée du Quartier latin for a night that is set to become one of the season's standout techno events.\n<br><br>\nFor the very first time, OCTOV is taking over Studio St-Denis, a spectacular venue that offers a unique playground for the immersive scenography the collective has become known for. More than a dancefloor, this is a full dive into the OCTOV universe.\n<br><br>\nThe lineup brings together three artists from Montreal's techno scene: \n<br><br>\n<b>Dopamyne</b>, OCTOV resident DJ and producer, is known for her hardgroove-driven sets, infectious energy and ability to build relentless tension from start to finish.\n<br><br>\n<b>H1bou</b> explores a more hypnotic and mental side of techno, crafting long, immersive journeys through deep textures and slowly evolving intensity. \n<br><br>\n<b>Ponsif</b> draws inspiration from European rave culture, blending powerful grooves, hypnotic melodies and driving rhythms with a strong focus on dancefloor energy.\n<br><br>\nFrom midnight to 6 a.m., the night promises a continuous journey shaped by a strong local lineup and a scenography designed to surround the crowd from every angle. It's a rare opportunity to experience Studio St-Denis transformed into a fully immersive environment where music, light and visuals become one, for a night with no compromises.\n\n</p>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){\niframe{width:100%;}\n}\n\n</style>"
      }
    ],
