    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "FIGHT FEST! - Dans le cadre de la série de boxe PAYMENT SPAYCE "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>GET READY, IT'S GOING TO HIT HARD!<br><br>\n\nOn Saturday, October 3rd, the prestigious Théâtre Saint-Denis is ablaze for a historic event: the <b>FIGHT FEST!</b><br><br>\n\nFor the first time, professional boxing and mixed martial arts come together in an explosive fighting festival! As part of the Payment Spayce Boxing Series, presented by Mise-O-Jeu, a promotion of I-BOX in collaboration with Samurai MMA, expect 9 firefights that will rock the walls of the theater!<br><br>\n\nLES DUELS QUI FONT FRISSONNER :<br>\n\n•        Main event: Quebec world calliber Heavyweight <b>Alexis Barrière</b> (13-1, 11 KOs) faces Alberta colossus <b>Stan Surmacz</b> (14-1, 9 KOs) for the NABO and IBF North America belts!<br>\n\n•         The <b>Persian Prince Mostafa Salehizadeh</b> (5-0), the strong man of MMA, defends his Samurai MMA belt in a clash that promises to be brutal!<br><br>\n\nMain Support Fight: The skilled and charismatic <b>Derek 'Slick' Pomerleau</b> (15-1, 11 KOs) of Mercier goes to the front against the Ontario champion <b>John-Michael Bianco</b> (9-1, 4 KOs) for the IBF North American title!<br><br>\n\nAlso on the bill:<br>\n•        The prodigy Omar Alieh (5-0, 5 KOs)<br>\n\n•        Sherbrooke's explosive Loick Lahaie (5-0, 3 KOs)<br>\n\n•        The popular Junior Petanqui (2-0, 1 KOs)<br><br>\n\nA spectacular, intense and unforgettable evening.<br>\n\nA real fight festival like Montreal has never seen.<br>\n\nIt's going to be brewing. It's going to explode. Be there!\n</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\ntw-seats-selectes-plv{display: none !important;}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
