    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/STINGMEVURL/performances/ST26JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/STINGMEVURL/performances/ST26JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "STING - 3.0 TOUR"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\n<p><strong>ULTIMATE VIP PACKAGE</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One (1) premium reserved ticket in the first 3 rows*</li>\n<li>First drink on us with one drink voucher**</li>\n<li>Specially designed VIP gift item</li>\n<li>Limited edition tour poster</li>\n<li>Commemorative ticket</li>\n<li>VIP laminate and lanyard</li>\n<li>Photo opportunity to commemorate your evening***</li>\n<li>Pre-show tour merchandise shopping opportunity (where available)</li>\n<li>Designated check-in and on-site VIP event staff</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>PREMIUM VIP PACKAGE</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One (1) premium reserved ticket in the first 12 rows*</li>\n<li>First drink on us with one drink voucher**</li>\n<li>Specially designed VIP gift item</li>\n<li>Limited edition tour poster</li>\n<li>Commemorative ticket</li>\n<li>VIP laminate and lanyard</li>\n<li>Photo opportunity to commemorate your evening***</li>\n<li>Pre-show tour merchandise shopping opportunity (where available)</li>\n<li>Designated check-in and on-site VIP event staff</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>With virtuoso guitarist and longtime collaborator, Dominic Miller, and dynamic drummer Chris Maas (Mumford & Sons, Maggie Rogers), fans will have an opportunity to see Sting perform the most electrifying hits and rarities from his timeless discography. The 'STING 3.0' World tour has had several swift sellouts and kicked off to rave reviews.\n<br><br>\nMelodic folk-rock singer and songwriter <b>Chance Emerson</b> will serve as the opening act for the « STING 3.0 » tour.</p>\n\n<p>*Locations may vary by venue, see specific dates for details.<br>\n**Local liquor laws apply.<br>\n***No artist participation.</p>\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){\niframe{width:100%;}\n}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
