  {
    "@id": "https://ticketpro.ca/event/1692584203",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-10-31T20:00:00-04:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "https://ticketpro.ca/place/1411850201"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/api/v1/resources/1692582102.jpeg?version=2"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/offers": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/af3e48592b787645"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/2301b281a7c57532"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1692582202/performances/QOR31JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1692582202/performances/QOR31JS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Queens of Rock"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>After 13 years of success, more than 200 performances in Las Vegas, and years of electrifying audiences across Quebec, Elyzabeth Diaga presents <b>THE GRAND FINALE</b> of the signature version of <i>Queens of Rock</i> at Montreal's Studio St-Denis.</p>\n\n<p>One final large-scale production featuring live musicians, immersive 360° projections, spectacular costumes, and all the explosive energy that has defined the show since 2013.</p>\n\n<p>From Heart to Lady Gaga, including Joan Jett, Pat Benatar, Alanis Morissette, Diane Dufresne, and many other iconic artists, <i>Queens of Rock</i> celebrates the greatest female voices in rock through a powerful tribute driven by Elyzabeth Diaga's commanding vocals and electrifying stage presence.</p>\n\n<p>Over the years, <i>Queens of Rock</i> has become a standout rock tribute production, fueled by 13 years of touring, a celebrated Las Vegas residency, and thousands of fans won over in Quebec and abroad.</p>\n\n<p>Elyzabeth Diaga is among the rare Canadian artists — and the 4th Canadian woman — to headline a residency on the legendary Las Vegas Strip, alongside artists such as Céline Dion and Shania Twain. Her work has also earned four distinctions, including the <i>Best Tribute Show</i> award from the <i>Las Vegas Review-Journal</i>.</p>\n\n<p>Presented in the immersive setting of Studio St-Denis, this grand finale promises a festive, high-energy, and unforgettable evening. A few surprises created especially for the occasion will also make this final performance even more memorable.</p>\n\n<p>For this unique celebration, audiences are invited to fully embrace the flamboyant spirit of the show — costumes and festive flair are highly encouraged.</p>\n\n<p><b>One final date. One final adrenaline rush. One last chance to experience it.</b></p>\n\n\n<p>⏱ Running time: approximately 90 minutes + intermission</p>\n\n\n\n\n"
      }
    ],
