  {
    "@id": "https://ticketpro.ca/event/1689798648",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2026-12-05T20:30:00-05:00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/location": [
      {
        "@id": "https://ticketpro.ca/place/1411850201"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/api/v1/resources/1691567709.jpeg?version=0"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/offers": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/5c7dfbefe0dc17d6"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/42cc3a50f9595665"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/9b23456e98bd96a7"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/42a4d63d81ef7057"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/01c8b04e16d27cec"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1689667766/performances/BG05LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1689667766/performances/BG05LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "BEE GEES CELEBRATION"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>It's Saturday night—every night.\n\n<p>He appears without warning. An imperfectly British suit. Perfectly eclectic. A mischievous gaze. A voice from another time. Sir Groove. Professor, DJ, storyteller. But above all: an archaeologist of forgotten frequencies. He looks at you and... chooses you. 'Tonight, you're not just a spectator...'</p>\n\n<p>Late 60s. London. A hushed club. A dinner. Soft lighting. A piano. A double bass. A musical breath. You're there. Seated. Elegant. A drink in hand. You feel. You listen to a forbidden, almost sacred frequency: The Gibb waves. Sir Groove whispers: 'You're starting to tune into the frequency.'</p>\n\n<p>Slowly, the frequency rises. The rhythm rumbles. We move and, suddenly, we're somewhere else. Under Buckingham, in a decadent palace, a clandestine club appears: Studio BeeDG comes to life. Expertly inspired by Studio 54, but London-style, paying tribute to New York's flair.</p>\n\n<p>The harmonies grow: <i>Nights on Broadway, Jive Talkin'</i>. Four voices rise and become a trio. Falsetto. Harmonies. A shiver. The groove sets in. The body responds before the mind. <i>You Should Be Dancing</i>. And then, bodies take the stage. Six dancers—fluid, sensual, uncontrollable—ignite the space. The four singers, joined by three musicians, intertwine and take control. Voices become light. Everything shifts.</p>\n\n<p>The club explodes. Showtime. Movement becomes contagious. <i>Stayin' Alive </i>and <i>Night Fever</i> flood the dance floor. Mirror balls float like planets. Vocal constellations cross the space.</p>\n\n<p>Bodies fall into trance to <i>More Than a Woman</i>, followed by an intimate <i>How Deep is Your Love</i>. Costumes vibrate: satin, light, colours. Every gesture catches the silver beam. The queens of disco appear like timeless icons. <i>Love You Inside Out</i> and <i>Too Much Heaven</i> shine.</p></p>\n\n<p>The mirror balls multiply. The voices rise. Higher. Higher still. And then, you understand... <i>Bee Gees Celebration</i> is not a concert. It's a kingdom.</p>\n\n<p>PSST... If you're already a fan of the excitement of <i>ABBA Celebration, Elvis Expérience Symphonique</i>, or <i>New Orleans Blues</i>, this show is for you!</p>\n\n \n\n<p><a href='https://esd2026.tor1.digitaloceanspaces.com/uploads/MenuSpectacleBeeGees-Final.pdf#asset:61173@2:url' target='_blank'>VIEW THE DINNER MENU.</a></p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n.tw-seats-selectes-plv {display: none;}\ntw-seats-selectes-plv{display: none !important;}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
