      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1692857462/performances/RB04CS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1692857462/performances/RB04CS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Rita Baga - Carrousel"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Following the resounding success of her first tour, Créature, which captivated more than 75,000 fans, and her latest show, Spraynet, Rita Baga will hit the road again across Quebec in the winter of 2027. More dazzling, extravagant, and electrifying than ever, the icon promises a colorful celebration where several guests will take turns setting the stage ablaze alongside her...</p>\n\n<p>With this brand-new show, Rita Baga opens the doors to a completely wild carnival universe, where humor, musical performances, drag, impersonations, and guest artists come together to create a spectacular party! Each act becomes an attraction in itself, somewhere between a wild cabaret and a glamorous circus. Like a mysterious Cabinet of Curiosities where she reigns as the flamboyant queen, the show comes to life in a setting as surprising as it is intoxicating: a luminous arcade, a Palace of Mirrors, neon lights, and glitter!</p>\n\n<p>The true queen of this carnival, Rita Baga promises an exuberant, festive, and unapologetically bold evening.  In short, 100% Rita! A whirlwind of music, laughter, and extravagance to celebrate the 20th anniversary of her career in style!</p>\n\n<style>\n\n.pricelevel-price-temp-to {display: none;}\n.pricelevel-price-temp-pricemax {display: none;}\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\ntw-seats-selectes-plv{display: none !important;}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
